  "historyNote": "#10603, eff 5-21-14 (from Puc 302.22); ss by #14106, eff 10-25-24, EXPIRES: 10-25-34 (formerly Puc 302.23) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Puc 300)",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
