  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc300.html",
  "prefLabel": "Puc 302.08 Utility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 302.08 “Utility” means any public utility as defined in RSA 362:2 owning, operating, or managing any plant or equipment or any part of the same for the transmission, distribution, or generation of electricity ultimately sold to the public within New Hampshire except:\n\n(a) Municipal corporations, to the extent exempt pursuant to RSA 362:4-a;\n\n(b) Entities specifically exempted from the definition of “public utility” pursuant to RSA 362:4-c; and\n\n(c) Competitive energy suppliers that have not requested public utility status pursuant to RSA 374-F:7, I.\n\nSource. #10603, eff 5-21-14 (from Puc 302.22); ss by #14106, eff 10-25-24, EXPIRES: 10-25-34 (formerly Puc 302.23) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Puc 300)",
